SUMMARY:New Year's Eve Showcase (lounge showroom)
LOCATION:DC Improv\, 1140 Connecticut Avenue NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:These shows are are in our lounge showroom. A showcase lineup i
 s also available in our main showroom.\n\nLaugh your way into 2027 with top
  comedians from the DMV! Get a great sampling of local talent and ring in t
 he new year in style. Plus\, everyone gets a pass for one free admission in
  2027.\n\n7:30 show: $35 per person GA. Everyone in attendance also gets a 
 free pass for a 2027 show at the DC Improv.\n\n10:15 countdown show: $75 pe
 r person GA. The ticket includes admission\, a champagne toast at midnight\
 , a fruit / cheese / cracker plate and party favors. Each person in attenda
 nce also gets a free pass for a 2027 show at the DC Improv.\n\nThe lineup: 
 Benny Nwokeabia\, Lafayette Wright\, Rob Stant\, Ty Davis\, Randy Syphax\, 
 Matt Deakins\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only
  when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons m
 ust be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any except
 ions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item mi
 nimum per customer. This can be any combination of food items or beverages.
  Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does n
 ot apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot
  be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll
  shows in our lounge are seated by seated by time of arrival. The earlier y
 ou arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that the size of your
  party can affect what options are available to you\, as certain tables and
  areas are designated for larger parties. Please note that if your party do
 es not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons
 .\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/new-year-s-eve-sho
 wcase-lounge-showroom/
